---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-line bg-ink px-6 py-12 text-center text-paper">
	<p class="font-display text-lg">
		Leder<span class="text-brass">Partner</span>
	</p>
	<p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-md font-body text-sm text-paper/70">
		Sparringspartneren du ikke har i eget team.
	</p>
	<div class="mt-6 flex justify-center gap-5 font-body text-sm text-paper/70">
		<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="transition-colors hover:text-paper">
			LinkedIn
		</a>
		<a href="https://www.facebook.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="transition-colors hover:text-paper">
			Facebook
		</a>
	</div>
	<p class="mt-8 font-body text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-paper/40">
		&copy; {year} Leder Partner. Alle rettigheter forbeholdt.
	</p>
</footer>
